<h3 id="题目描述">题目描述：</h3>
<p>下载附件，解压得到一个.exe文件。</p>
<h3 id="密文">密文：</h3>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251218085607603.png">
